---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import LocalizedText from "../components/LocalizedText.astro";
import { site } from "../config/site";
---

<BaseLayout title="隐私与数据说明" description="小B个人网站的数据处理、第三方服务和照片发布说明。">
  <section class="section privacy-page">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="page-hero" data-reveal>
        <div class="eyebrow">Site note / privacy</div>
        <h1><LocalizedText zh="隐私与数据说明" en="Privacy & data" /></h1>
        <p>
          <LocalizedText
            zh="这里说明本站会处理什么、不会处理什么，以及发布照片和小吉终端资料时需要注意的边界。"
            en="This page explains what the site does and does not process, along with the boundaries for publishing photographs and Xiaoji Terminal material."
          />
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="privacy-grid">
        <article class="notice-panel" data-reveal>
          <h2><LocalizedText zh="可选访问统计（默认关闭）" en="Optional visit analytics (off by default)" /></h2>
          <p><LocalizedText zh="只有选择“允许访问统计”后，本站才会创建独立统计标识，记录允许页面的访问及试玩入口点击。不记录查询参数、JSON 工具输入、聊天正文、密钥、联系方式或原始 IP。匿名标识与同意/拒绝偏好最多保留 30 天；它是浏览器标识，不代表无法关联的完全匿名数据。" en="Only after you choose Allow visit analytics do we create separate analytics identifiers and record approved page visits and clicks to try Xiaoji Terminal. Query parameters, JSON tool input, chat text, keys, contact details and raw IP addresses are excluded. Identifiers and allow/decline preferences last up to 30 days. A browser identifier does not guarantee complete anonymity." /></p>
          <p><LocalizedText zh="可随时通过“访问统计设置”撤销；本来源所有已打开标签页会停止后续访问统计并清除统计标识，不修改主题、语言、聊天或其他业务存储。已接收事件不会因撤销自动删除：原始统计事件保留目标 7 天，匿名辅助记录最多 30 天，日聚合最多 90 天。浏览器 GPC 或 DNT 信号也会关闭访问统计。" en="Withdraw at any time through Visit analytics settings. Open tabs on this origin stop future visit analytics and remove analytics identifiers, without changing theme, language, chat or other application storage. Withdrawal does not automatically delete already accepted events: raw statistical events have a 7-day retention target, identifier support records up to 30 days and daily aggregates up to 90 days. Browser GPC or DNT signals also disable visit analytics." /></p>
          <p><LocalizedText zh="个人网站与小吉终端各自决定是否允许，各自保存标识，不合并长期或跨设备身份。仅当两端均已允许时，用一次性跳转编号关联点击后 30 分钟内的成功对话；目的站尚未允许时会丢弃编号，之后允许也不补报先前入口。采集和本机分析只用于本站使用情况与服务改进，公开页仅展示延迟汇总并隐藏不满足发布条件的小样本；缺失数据不等于零。" en="The personal site and Xiaoji Terminal keep separate choices and identifiers, without merging long-term or cross-device identity. When both sites have already been allowed, a one-time entry code links a successful conversation within 30 minutes of the click. The destination discards the code if permission has not been given; allowing later does not report earlier entries. Collection and local analysis support usage understanding and service improvement. Only delayed aggregates are public, with small samples withheld; missing values do not mean zero." /></p>
        </article>
        <article class="notice-panel" data-reveal>
          <h2><LocalizedText zh="独立的服务质量统计" en="Separate service quality statistics" /></h2>
          <p><LocalizedText zh="小吉终端从既有脱敏生成完成日志提取请求编号、公开角色、完成时间、成功与否及耗时，用于已记录生成请求的数量和成功率。此处理不依赖浏览器访问统计同意，不带访问统计匿名/会话标识，也不读取聊天正文、密钥或详细错误。请求数量不代表所有 HTTP 请求或全部聊天尝试；公开日志未覆盖的失败不能解释为成功。" en="Xiaoji Terminal extracts request IDs, public characters, completion times, outcomes and duration from its existing filtered generation-completion logs to count recorded generations and their success rate. This is independent of the visit analytics choice and includes no visit/session identifiers, chat text, keys or detailed errors. These counts do not represent every HTTP request or chat attempt, and failures absent from the logs must not be interpreted as successes." /></p>
        </article>
        <article class="notice-panel" data-reveal>
          <p class="section-kicker"><LocalizedText zh="本站本身" en="This site" /></p>
          <h2><LocalizedText zh="个人站是静态页面，试玩入口是独立服务" en="The personal site is static; the preview is a separate service" /></h2>
          <p>
            <LocalizedText
              zh="个人站由 Astro 构建并部署在 Cloudflare Pages；模型 IQ 页面只读取 Codex Radar 的公开摘要。个人站没有账号系统；JSON 工具输入仅在当前浏览器页面处理，不上传服务器，也不保存到本地存储。点击小吉终端试玩后会进入 snow.xiaob.dev，那是具有独立隐私说明的动态服务。"
              en="The personal site is built with Astro and deployed on Cloudflare Pages; Model IQ only reads Codex Radar's public summary. The personal site has no account system. JSON tool input is processed only in the current browser page, never uploaded or saved to local storage. Xiaoji Terminal opens snow.xiaob.dev, a dynamic service with its own privacy notice."
            />
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="notice-panel" data-reveal>
          <p class="section-kicker"><LocalizedText zh="浏览器偏好" en="Browser preferences" /></p>
          <h2><LocalizedText zh="主题、语言与可选统计偏好" en="Theme, language and optional analytics preferences" /></h2>
          <p>
            <LocalizedText
              zh="主题和语言切换会保存在当前浏览器的本地存储中（x1ao-theme、x1ao-locale），用于记住你的显示偏好；清除浏览器站点数据即可删除。"
              en="Theme and language choices are stored in this browser's local storage (x1ao-theme and x1ao-locale) so your display preference can persist; clearing this site's browser data removes them."
            />
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="notice-panel" data-reveal>
          <p class="section-kicker">小吉终端</p>
          <h2><LocalizedText zh="API Key、聊天记录与反馈有不同边界" en="API keys, chat history, and feedback have different boundaries" /></h2>
          <p>
            <LocalizedText
              zh="API Key 会短暂经过小吉终端服务器内存并发送到所选官方模型接口，但不写入数据库、磁盘、反馈或日志；加密凭证只保留在当前标签页，最长 12 小时。聊天、摘要、草稿与收藏以明文保存在当前浏览器 IndexedDB。反馈上下文可预览或取消，正文与可选加密 QQ 保存 30 天。"
              en="An API key briefly passes through Xiaoji Terminal server memory to the selected official model endpoint, but is not written to the database, disk, feedback, or logs; its encrypted credential remains in the current tab for up to 12 hours. Chats, summaries, drafts, and favorites are plaintext in the current browser's IndexedDB. Feedback context can be previewed or removed, while feedback text and optional encrypted QQ are retained for 30 days."
            />
          </p>
          <a class="text-link" href={site.external.projectSnowPrivacy} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><LocalizedText zh="阅读游戏完整隐私与素材说明 ↗" en="Read the full game privacy & asset notice ↗" /></a>
        </article>

        <article class="notice-panel" data-reveal>
          <p class="section-kicker"><LocalizedText zh="第三方服务" en="Third-party services" /></p>
          <h2><LocalizedText zh="按需加载评论和外部链接" en="Comments and external links load on demand" /></h2>
          <p>
            <LocalizedText
              zh="启用 Giscus 后，文章页会加载 giscus.app 和 GitHub Discussions 的评论组件；评论需要使用 GitHub 账号，相关处理遵循 GitHub 和 Giscus 的政策。模型 IQ 页面会从 codexradar.com 读取公开摘要。小吉终端会将模型请求发送到你选择的官方供应商，并通过 Cloudflare 提供服务；具体范围见游戏自身说明。"
              en="When Giscus is enabled, article pages load the giscus.app and GitHub Discussions comment component. Comments require a GitHub account and follow GitHub and Giscus policies. Model IQ reads a public summary from codexradar.com. Xiaoji Terminal sends model requests to the official provider you choose and is served through Cloudflare; see the game's own notice for scope."
            />
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="notice-panel" data-reveal>
          <p class="section-kicker"><LocalizedText zh="照片与资料" en="Photos and sources" /></p>
          <h2><LocalizedText zh="发布前自行检查公开范围" en="Check the public scope before publishing" /></h2>
          <p>
            <LocalizedText
              zh="摄影集图片会随 Git 和静态站点一起发布。上传前请自行移除不希望公开的定位和设备信息，并只发布自己拥有版权或获得授权的照片。小吉终端按固定修订逐项记录知识资料、头像与表情的来源、许可和处理；页面特殊声明优先，游戏及角色原始内容版权归其权利人。"
              en="Gallery images are published with Git and the static site. Remove location and device metadata you do not wish to share, and publish only photos you own or are licensed to use. Xiaoji Terminal records source, license, and transformation for knowledge, avatar, and sticker assets against fixed revisions, subject to page-specific notices; game and original character rights remain with their owners."
            />
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
